The beeping issues from the desktop. Had to research the possible meaning behind the sounds. Reminded me of the POST code that I had forgotten, and provided the theory to the issue. 

Resolution

All ticket issues were resolved, provided a polite comment, and closed out.  

Key Takeaways

While some issues may seem simple to technicians, they can be irritating to the end user. 
Verifying all physical connections are properly connected can be a simple thing to overlook, but it can also provide a simple resolution. 
Do not be afraid to look something up or ask if you are not familiar with the issue to help resolve the problem or identify if it needs to be escalated. 

